OrderProgressHintProposalCreated = Open the form to draft a quotation for this customer
OrderProgressHintProposalSigned = Send the quotation to the customer and mark it accepted when they confirm
OrderProgressHintOrderCreated = Create the order to proceed
OrderProgressHintOrderValidated = Open the order and validate it to put it in process
OrderProgressHintShipmentDone = Create a shipment and close it once the goods are dispatched
OrderProgressHintInvoiceCreated = Create the invoice from this order
OrderProgressHintInvoicePaid = Open the invoice to record a payment
OrderProgressHintOrderClosed = Close the order once everything is fulfilled
OrderProgressHintSupplierProposalCreated = Create a request for quotation from this supplier
OrderProgressHintOrderApproved = Open the order and approve it to proceed
OrderProgressHintOrderSent = Mark the order as sent and placed with the supplier
OrderProgressHintReceptionDone = Validate the delivery then close the reception to complete this step
OrderProgressHintInvoiceReceived = Book the supplier invoice against this order

